{
  "method": "Synthetic disfluency controls replayed through the actual offline text model. Check hesitation and stutter removal alongside meaningful particles, reduplication, approximate quantities, precise values, identifiers, language switches, edited text and verbatim mode. These selected cases are not a speech-recognition accuracy benchmark.",
